      Ragas vs TruLens: <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 via-indigo-300 to-cyan-400">Automated RAG Pipeline Evaluation Framework Comparison</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 pb-6 border-b border-slate-800">
      <span>Published: September 4, 2026</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Tested on: Ragas v0.2.x & TruLens v1.1.x</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Read Time: 10 min</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box (45-60 words) -->
