      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Production Implementation Blueprint & Automated Verification</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The following copy-pasteable, error-handled implementation provides a hardened foundation for deploying <strong>Ragas vs TruLens: RAG Evaluation Benchmark (2026)</strong> in production environments. It includes strict defensive validation, timeout thresholds, and automated health checks:
